  "strategy": "A radically transformed approach that first verifies a normalization essential for the search. We introduce a structured peak detection method and integrate it with cold-start adaptive gradient updates and then with constrained optimization. This approach also includes targeted mutation towards the flatten of energy distribution across the convolution.\n1.Initialize normalization factor based on the provided sequence length.\n2.Convert all sequences to log-sum space to enforce positivity and boundedness.\n3.Detect peak indices in linear combination.\n4.Normalize all sequences to maintain the energy constraint.\n5.Apply gradient descent with adaptive cooling and dimension selection.\n6.Fit Gaussian processes to guide mutation process.\n7.Enforce the condition that the search process leaves the original scale preserved.\n8.Integrate convex optimization for local minima detection.",
